# Images are served from the WordPress Media Library for the review preview.
#
# The repository holds every asset in public/assets and that is where they will
# be served from at cutover; the preview points at the Media Library because the
# deployment is created through Vercel's file API, where shipping binaries is
# avoidable and the same files are already public at that origin.
#
# Remove this line to serve images from the frontend's own origin.
NEXT_PUBLIC_MEDIA_ORIGIN=https://novraintelligence.wordpress.com
